--- discord ---
### Appeals
A member can appeal each case once, from Quack's DM or from the dashboard, even after a ban. Choose the appeal channel with </setup:1004>. Moderators accept or reject appeals there, with </appeals:1002>, or on the dashboard, and Quack tries to send the member a DM with the decision. Accepting an appeal voids the case, and Quack removes the timeout or ban it placed when Discord still shows it.
buttons: [Open the dashboard](https://quack.example/guilds/111/cases/12)
--- plain ---
